// Build settings for the app target (project.yml, configFiles).
//
// The Sentry DSN comes from a gitignored file next to this one, Config/Sentry.xcconfig: written by
// ci_scripts/ci_post_clone.sh on Xcode Cloud, or by hand for a local test (docs/SENTRY.md).
// Without it the DSN is empty, the app sends nothing, and an archive stops (project.yml).

SENTRY_DSN =
#include? "Sentry.xcconfig"
